# GOV.UK Web log data - Bot Detection
This documentation provides an overview of the bot detection branch of the Dataform workflow for processing Fastly web log data. The bot detection workflow is designed to process and analyse web log data to identify and classify known and suspected bot traffic.
For more information on the content traffic workflow, see [GOV.UK Web log data - Content traffic](https://docs.data-community.publishing.service.gov.uk/data-sources/web-log-data/content-traffic/).

[GitHub Repository](https://github.com/alphagov/fastly-dataform)

## Dataform workflow

